      <p>
        I'm Sīlavāpi - you may have known me as Ruth Cheesley. I work in the open,
        currently as Project Lead for <strong>Mautic</strong>, the open source
        marketing automation project, and for years before that across open source
        communities. Alongside that I'm an ordained Buddhist, a trustee of
        <strong>Breathworks</strong>, and someone who has learned to live a full and
        active life with Ehlers-Danlos Syndrome - lately by running rather further
        than is sensible.
      </p>
      <p>
        None of these are really separate. The way I try to show up in open source,
